npc.Trork_Crier.name = Trork crier
npc.Trork_Merchant.name = Trork trader
npc.Trork_Chief.name = Trork chief
npc.Klops_Wanderer.name = Wandering Klops
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.aurevoir = I'm off.
dialogue.hint.meat = +40 camp reputation, up to Tolerated
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.failViande = you need 5 Raw meat, at the camp
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.offrirViande = Here, meat. (5 Raw meat)
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.travail = Give me work.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.honni = GRRR. You no Trork. You meat, or you leave. Or you do work, maybe.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.mange = *chews loudly* ... Good. You smell less.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.voir = Show me the requests.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.accueil = Camp is hungry and cold. Board says what to do. You do, camp happy.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.rendre = Here's what I have.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.encours = So? You bring?
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.rendu = Hmph. Good work. Chief will know.
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.npc = Loud-Maw
dialogue.Trork_Crieur.role = Camp crier
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.aurevoir = Later.
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.troc = Show your junk.
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.armes = Trork weapons?
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.armure = The chief's stash.
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.honni = Hssss. No trade with meat.
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.etranger = You prove nothing. Bring trophy teeth, then we talk.
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.accueil = Bones, hides, blades. All trade for teeth.
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.npc = Bone-Mother
dialogue.Trork_Marchand.role = Camp trader
request.Trork_Chain_Wolves.title = Hunt the wolves
request.Trork_Chain_Wolves.task = Wolves slain: {count}/{needed}. The pack prowls {distance} blocks away, {direction}.
request.Trork_Chain_Mosshorn.title = Slay two Mosshorns
request.Trork_Chain_Mosshorn.task = Mosshorns slain: {count}/{needed}. They graze {distance} blocks away, {direction}.
request.Trork_Chain_Rival.title = Beat the rival clan
request.Trork_Chain_Rival.task = Rival clan Trorks slain: {count}/{needed}. Their brawler waits {distance} blocks away, {direction}.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.aurevoir = May your blade stay red.
dialogue.hint.rival = one rank lower with the Kweebecs
dialogue.Trork_Chef.failViande = you must be Tolerated by the Trorks and carry 10 Raw meat
dialogue.Trork_Chef.offrirViande = Here, meat. (5 Raw meat)
dialogue.Trork_Chef.honni = You smell of Kweebec. My lot would gladly eat you. Bring meat, or leave.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.mange = Hmm. Meat talks better than you. Keep going.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.voirDemandes = See the requests
dialogue.Trork_Chef.etranger = You're not one of us yet. Feed the camp, do what the board says. Come back tolerated.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.donnerViande = Here are ten meats.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.feu = The camp fire is hungry, and a hungry camp fights badly. Ten raw meats, and I'll know if you keep your word.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.accepter = I'm going.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.loups = The camp eats. Now hunt with us: a pack of black wolves prowls. When you are our friend.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.loupsEnCours = The pack still lives. Go.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.mosshorn = Good hunt. A true Trork brings a Mosshorn hide. Two beasts, no less.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.mosshornEnCours = The Mosshorns await. Come back with their blood.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.rival = A rival clan camps on our hunting grounds. Their brawler thinks he's strong. When you are our host, show him.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.rivalEnCours = The rival brawler still breathes. Not for long.
dialogue.hint.chainPaint = passage item of the Trork road
dialogue.Trork_Chef.recevoirPeinture = Receive the War paint
dialogue.Trork_Chef.peinture = The rival clan fled. My lot sing your name. I give the war paint only to the camp's champion.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.fin = Painted, you walk among Trorks. The Kweebecs will look at you askance.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.accepte = Go. Come back with blood on your hands.
dialogue.Trork_Chef.npc = Iron-Fang
dialogue.Trork_Chef.role = Camp chief
dialogue.Klops_Errant.aurevoir = Safe travels!
dialogue.Klops_Errant.troc = Let's see your wares.
dialogue.hint.parcel = 3 cogs and +30 reputation on delivery
dialogue.Klops_Errant.colis = Got a parcel to carry?
dialogue.Klops_Errant.route = Where are you off to tomorrow?
dialogue.Klops_Errant.accueil = Hello hello! Cogs, favours, parcels: a Klops never stops rolling.
dialogue.Klops_Errant.colisTexte = Fragile, fragile! Carry it to the village heart, they'll pay you in cogs.
dialogue.Klops_Errant.routeTexte = The road, always the road! Come find me there.
dialogue.Klops_Errant.npc = Tinker
dialogue.Klops_Errant.role = Wandering Klops
